<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam's inflation rate picks up in November.</title>
<headline>Vietnam's inflation rate picks up in November.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's General Statistics Office issued the following economic indicators on Monday:</p>
<p> VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICES		 Nov 96     Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month percentage change     +0.9	 +0.1	 +0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year percentage change	 +3.8	 +2.9	+13.8</p>
<p> Index base (base 100 = prev. Dec)   103.5	102.6	112.4</p>
</text>
